        <mxCell id="complete-overview-access-preconditions" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.35;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sign-in, recovery and protected access&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sign In: validate credentials and continue to CV upload. Incorrect email or password allows retry.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reset Password: recover access, reset the password and return to sign-in.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;All preparation, report and progress goals require a signed-in candidate. An existing session can go straight to CV upload or My Progress.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#173C43;shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF9E8;strokeColor=#C7B57B;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="complete-overview-system">
