        <mxCell id="complete-overview-interview-setup" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.35;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Setup, voice answers and completion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set up the mock interview and test the microphone.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Present one question at a time and collect the submitted voice answers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;After the final answer: evaluate the interview, generate its report and save the completed attempt in Interview History.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A low matching score does not prevent starting the interview.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#173C43;shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF9E8;strokeColor=#C7B57B;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="complete-overview-system">
